795550347,"stop_ts":1795552706,"duration_minutes":39,"season":null,"episode":null,"episode_title":null,"is_live":false,"is_rerun":false},{"show_id":"x5e6a86e79c","start":"2026-11-24T20:38:26Z","stop":"2026-11-24T21:00:00Z","start_ts":1795552706,"stop_ts":1795554000,"duration_minutes":22,"season":null,"episode":null,"episode_title":null,"is_live":false,"is_rerun":false}]},"shows":{"mv571265":{"show_id":"mv571265","tmdb_id":571265,"content_type":"animation","title":"الموسم الأول","title_en":"Digimon Adventure: Last Evolution Kizuna","title_fr":"Digimon Adventure : Last Evolution Kizuna","original_title":"デジモンアドベンチャー LAST EVOLUTION 絆","tagline":null,"description":"مسلسل كوميدي إجتماعي تدور أحداثه حول صحفية تعمل بنفس الجريدة التى يعمل بها زوجها، وينشأ بينهما صراع فكري بسبب مواقفهما السياسية المختلفة بعد ثورة 25 يناير. يوضح المسلسل شكل العلاقة بين الزوجين في حياتهما الخاصة وفى حياتهما العملية، كاشفًا في السياق العديد من السلوكيات الخاصة بالرجل الشرقي. بطولة:داليا البحيري بدور انجي.خالد سرحان بدور علي.سمير غانم بدور سمير.رجاء الجداوي بدور رجاء.","description_en":"Tai is now a university student, living alone, working hard at school, and working every day, but with his future still undecided. Meanwhile, Matt and others continue to work on Digimon incidents and activities that help people with their partner Digimon. When an unprecedented phenomenon occurs, the DigiDestined discover that when they grow up, their relationship with their partner Digimon will come closer to an end.","description_fr":"Plusieurs incidents inexplicables se produisent un peu partout et des enfants élus du monde entier perdent connaissance. Menoa et son assistant Imura - deux universitaires dont le domaine de recherche sont les Digimon – sollicitent Taichi et ses amis pour tenter d’élucider ces mystérieux phénomènes. Ils leur expliquent qu’Eosmon, un Digimon inconnu, serait à l’origine de tous ces incidents.  Ensemble, ils décident d’unir leur force pour l’affronter dans une terrible bataille. Mais l’issue du combat révèle une vérité bien difficile à admettre : lorsqu’un enfant élu devient adulte, son partenaire Digimon disparaît… La menace continue de se propager et touche bientôt les amis proches de Taichi. Ce dernier va alors se retrouver confronté au pire des dilemmes : choisir entre ses amis et son Digimon. Doit-il sauver ses amis, au risque de perdre son partenaire Digimon, son compagnon le plus cher ?","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zybqdwZNNYim7JnNAJiExYPhy82.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pQdZmXq0vvKP1RYUrDHQkzMlS4x.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":8.1,"vote_count":276,"age_rating":"G","year":"2020","release_date":"2020-02-21","runtime_minutes":95,"status":"Released","country":"اليابان","language":"اليابانية","genres":["رسوم متحركة","حركة","مغامرة","فانتازيا"],"genre_keys":["animation","action","adventure","fantasy"],"similar":["tv15260","mv1465063","tv62211","mv508422","mv893723","tv286791","tv120161","tv271597"],"director":"田口智久","cast":[{"name":"ناتسوكي هاناي","character":"Taichi Yagami (voice)","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/alTb0DlcPIbcwM08WSmxFai58sd.jpg"},{"name":"ماو إيتشيميتشي","character":"Hikari Yagami (voice)","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/a3cflYtrlFK0LXfWODgLDO7E7CP.jpg"},{"name":"三森すずこ","character":"Sora Takenouchi (voice)","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/zsUuNDI3rLh0ngDUUWcwfjQn9Od.jpg"},{"name":"細谷佳正","character":"Yamato Ishida (voice)","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lUR5oN1LrqGgp25IOcI1qOH1Ud5.jpg"},{"name":"جونيا إينوكي","character":"Takeru Takaishi (voice)","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/vBnNL3Jqy0zkS3ZgsXZmvDM9Dfz.jpg"},{"name":"موتسومي تامورا","character":"Koshiro Izumi (voice)","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/uvbBIRiBK6GDLEESiYSFWOVlaE4.jpg"},{"name":"吉田仁美","character":"Mimi Tachikawa (voice)","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7CtSdWTVY1b2I6oipfj53P3a2Zm.jpg"},{"name":"池田純矢","charac